WEBVTT

00:21:56.700 --> 00:22:00.927
Now, Rick Warren
didn't invent this clever move.

00:22:00.951 --> 00:22:02.141
It's an old move.

00:22:02.649 --> 00:22:05.200
It's a very clever
adaptation of religions.

00:22:05.224 --> 00:22:08.820
It's a wild card for disarming
any reasonable criticism.

00:22:10.546 --> 00:22:12.268
"You don't like my interpretation?

00:22:12.292 --> 00:22:14.244
You've got a reasonable objection to it?

00:22:14.268 --> 00:22:15.764
Don't listen, don't listen!

00:22:16.321 --> 00:22:18.000
That's the Devil speaking."

00:22:19.185 --> 00:22:24.786
This discourages the sort
of reasoning citizenship

00:22:24.810 --> 00:22:26.862
it seems to me that we want to have.

00:22:27.668 --> 00:22:29.976
I've got one more problem,
then I'm through.